Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:43.10,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:42.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:48.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
