Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:55.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:56.02,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:55.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:20:00.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:00.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:08.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:08.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:13.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:13.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:21.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:21.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:25.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:25.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:29.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:29.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:35.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.22,0:20:35.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:39.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:42.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:42.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:48.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My unshakable Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:48.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}aspires to ascend.
